{"id":"eeb222b4a42f9b55","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-cor-fodor-cor.md","title":"Fodor Corollary Stationary","display":"cor-fodor-cor — Fodor Corollary Stationary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-fodor-cor","aliases":["58-cor-fodor-cor"],"display":"cor-fodor-cor — Fodor Corollary Stationary","depends_on":["[[58-thm-fodor]]","[[58-df-stationary]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","[[58-df-regressive-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-fodor-cor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-fodor-cor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-fodor-cor — Fodor Corollary Stationary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3b01159c2b5601b\" href=\"?note=e3b01159c2b5601b\" title=\"58-thm-fodor\">58-thm-fodor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"58-df-stationary\">58-df-stationary</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" href=\"?note=aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" title=\"58-df-regressive-function\">58-df-regressive-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (正则不可数基数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"58-df-stationary\">58-df-stationary</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(S\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span> (stationary set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:S\\to\\kappa\">\\(f:S\\to\\kappa\\)</span> (regressive function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}\\)</span> (stationarity predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"58-df-stationary\">58-df-stationary</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Regressive}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Regressive}_S\\)</span> (regressive-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" href=\"?note=aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" title=\"58-df-regressive-function\">58-df-regressive-function</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}fodor-cor} \\vdash \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\\to\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\xi\\in S:f(\\xi)=\\alpha\\},\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}fodor-cor} \\vdash \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\\to\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\xi\\in S:f(\\xi)=\\alpha\\},\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the stationary-fiber form of Fodor's lemma.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-thm-fodor","status":"resolved","id":"e3b01159c2b5601b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-fodor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-stationary","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-stationary]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regressive-function","status":"resolved","id":"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regressive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-stationary","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ (正则不可数基数, see [[58-df-stationary]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S$ (regular-cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-regular-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-stationary","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Stationary}$ (stationarity predicate, see [[58-df-stationary]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regressive-function","status":"resolved","id":"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Regressive}_S$ (regressive-function predicate, see [[58-df-regressive-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"S\\